   "text": "Some refunds start when the carrier first scans the return",
   "conditional": true,
   "condition": "only for returns eligible for an advanced refund"
  },
  {
   "id": "inspect",
   "text": "Returned items are inspected against the expected item",
   "conditional": true,
   "condition": "only when an item is sent back"
  },
  {
   "id": "issued",
   "text": "The refund is issued to the original payment method"
  },
  {
   "id": "travel",
   "text": "A card refund travels back through the card network to the bank that issued the card"
  },
  {
   "id": "bank_posts",
   "text": "The bank posts the refund, on business days"
  },
  {
   "id": "arrives",
   "text": "The customer sees the refund in their account"
  }
 ],
 "claims": [
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "text": "Most items can be returned within 30 days of delivery; to start a return, go to Your Orders and click Return Items.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKM69DUUYKQWKWX7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "text": "A refund is provided once Amazon (or the third-party seller) has received the item and determined you are eligible.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKM69DUUYKQWKWX7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "text": "Third-party sellers who ship their own items may offer a full refund without requesting the item be returned.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKM69DUUYKQWKWX7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "text": "Advanced refunds are issued when a carrier first scans your return, rather than when it is received and processed.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKQNFKFK5CF3C54B"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c5",
   "text": "All returns are inspected against the expected item; refunds are reduced for signs of use, damage or missing parts.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKQNFKFK5CF3C54B"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c6",
   "text": "Refund processing times: credit card 3-5 business days; debit card up to 10 business days; Amazon gift card 2-3 hours.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKQNFKFK5CF3C54B"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c7",
   "text": "Once Amazon issues your refund, it may take additional time for your financial institution to make funds available.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKM69DUUYKQWKWX7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c8",
   "text": "Card refunds are submitted to the customer's bank or card issuer and appear as a credit some business days later, depending on the bank (payment-industry documentation).",
   "sources": [
    "https://docs.stripe.com/refunds"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c9",
   "text": "Most returns can be dropped off for free at many locations, and most returns do not need to be boxed or labeled.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKM69DUUYKQWKWX7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c10",
   "text": "Refunds go to the refund method selected; if the original payment method can't be used, refunds go to the Amazon account balance.",
   "sources": [
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GKQNFKFK5CF3C54B",
    "https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GMP8PC8KBY5FCPM2"
   ]
  }
 ],
